break-all;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:blue\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:blue\">rattle()<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.45pt;background:#e1e2e5;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#c5060b\">R session is headless; GTK+ not initialized.<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.45pt;background:#e1e2e5;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#c5060b\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.45pt;background:#e1e2e5;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#c5060b\">(R:4112): Gdk-CRITICAL **: IA__gdk_cursor_new_for_display: assertion `GDK_IS_DISPLAY (display)&#39; failed<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Manish<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;rattle-users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rattle-users...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nrattle...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rattle-users\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rattle-users&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478382040000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01I3tGUN4aOTid-hTVzwo1\"